      "contributions": [
        "Motivates measuring concentration in low-dimensional embedding subspaces alongside pairwise cosine similarity."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "Embedding geometry alone does not identify the cause of a BERT4Rec ranking failure.",
        "Effective rank is an auxiliary diagnostic, not the model-selection objective."
      ]
    }
